 wide!"},{"from":8.8,"to":9.7,"who":"REYES","text":"He's not hiding. He's waiting."},{"from":9.8,"to":11.2,"who":"KNOX","text":"Behind me, Miller. He has to come through me."},{"from":11.70401465190407,"to":12.60401465190407,"who":"REYES","text":"MILLER!"},{"from":13.054014651904069,"to":14.954014651904068,"who":"KNOX","text":"It switched us. He wanted me in front. Man down!"},{"from":15,"to":16,"who":"FUSE","text":"On him. He's breathing."},{"from":16.2,"to":17.6,"who":"KNOX","text":"Get him out. I'm your wall."},{"from":17.9,"to":19.8,"who":"REYES","text":"It takes whoever's closest. Like the count."},{"from":20.1,"to":22.4,"who":"KNOX","text":"Then nobody stays in here. Everyone out. We shut it."},{"from":22.7,"to":24.3,"who":"FUSE","text":"He's not letting you go, Knox."},{"from":24.6,"to":26.6,"who":"KNOX","text":"He will. Fuse, on the door. On my mark."},{"from":27.5,"to":28.299999999999997,"who":"KNOX","text":"Mark!"},{"from":29.25,"to":30.25,"who":"FUSE","text":"Door's shut."},{"from":30.4,"to":32.4,"who":"DISPATCH","text":"Pulse is out. Cole's the only one in reach."},{"from":32.6,"to":34.4,"who":"KNOX","text":"Cole. When you land, you run."},{"from":35.31134563990721,"to":36.51134563990721,"who":"COLE","text":"...I'm out. I'm out."},{"from":37.71134563990721,"to":39.111345639907206,"who":"FUSE","text":"Shut. He's in the cell."}],"guard":{"A":{"interp":"linear","keys":[[0,1],[0.05,1],[0.1,1],[0.15,1],[0.2,1],[0.25,1],[0.3,1],[0.35,1],[0.4,1],[0.45,1],[0.5,1],[0.55,1],[0.6,1],[0.65,1],[0.7,1],[0.75,1],[0.8,1],[0.85,1],[0.9,1.9],[0.95,1.63],[1,1.441],[1.05,1.308],[1.1,1.216],[1.15,1.151],[1.2,1.106],[1.25,1.074],[1.3,1.052],[1.35,1.036],[1.4,1.025],[1.45,1.018],[1.5,1],[1.55,1],[1.6,1.9],[1.65,1.63],[1.7,1.441],[1.75,1.308],[1.8,1.216],[1.85,1.151],[1.9,1.106],[1.95,1.074],[2,1.952],[2.05,1.666],[2.1,1.466],[2.15,1.326],[2.2,1.216],[2.25,1.151],[2.3,1.106],[2.35,1.074],[2.4,1.052],[2.45,1.036],[2.5,1.025],[2.55,1.018],[2.6,1.012],[2.65,1],[2.7,1],[2.75,1],[2.